8:53:15.853Z\n\n## 林雪（人物设定）\n\n- **身份**：渡口的船工，林舟的姐姐，比林舟大六岁。\n- **旧疤**：十二岁那年在船坞被缆绳割伤左手腕，留下一道旧疤。\n- **七结绳**：她把伤她的那根缆绳剪下一截，系在船头；绳上打了七个结，每个结代表一个她没能渡过河的人。\n- **禁忌**：从不在船上唱歌——母亲当年是在船上唱着歌落水的。\n\n以后写到林雪，一律按此设定，不得与之矛盾。</tool_result>", "token_count": 401, "source_class": "memory_read_result", "source_version": "01a1e5b5-8b16-7890-8a8c-31933542f032", "projection_mode": "exact_required"}], "considered": [{"eligible": true, "token_count": 0, "source_class": "host_control", "source_version": "01a1e5b5-8b2e-7620-a714-f9b6d21dc683"}, {"eligible": true, "token_count": 48, "source_class": "author_instruction", "source_version": "01a1e5b5-8b2e-7620-a714-f9c927e673e3"}, {"eligible": true, "token_count": 31, "source_class": "working_target", "source_version": "01a1e5b3-ae6c-72c3-9f8a-7693208c1db5"}, {"eligible": true, "token_count": 0, "source_class": "instruction_binding", "source_version": "absent"}, {"eligible": true, "token_count": 38, "source_class": "chapter_list", "source_version": "sha256:bd5cee696386e999254f550cdef04a54ce4b9293ff6e18b90edd0dd31ec54810"}, {"eligible": true, "token_count": 96, "source_class": "memory_index", "source_version": "sha256:20fcf10b279dc54aa9208ef6f293690f8b04e7119a96de13e6e86b18c3104def"}, {"eligible": true, "token_count": 401, "source_class": "memory_read_result", "source_version": "01a1e5b5-8b16-7890-8a8c-31933542f032"}], "sufficiency": {"kind": "complete"}, "operation_requirement": {"cause": "tool_result_continuation", "run_id": "01a1e5b5-79a9-7220-afa3-3bec91306612", "purpose": "current_passage_assistance", "chapter_id": "01a1e5b3-90c2-7d22-8fa6-4c1ef3fb8b15", "project_id": "01a1e5b3-0f26-7b52-a241-5f71c569c543", "instruction": {"kind": "absent"}, "tool_results": [{"state": "ok", "trust": "data_only", "call_id": "call_gpuvux6k4qq0qdy428gnv7xc", "decision_id": "01a1e5b5-8b14-7e03-8081-e3ac1a04b3e0", "tool_call_id": "01a1e5b5-8b16-7890-8a8c-31933542f032", "model_attempt_id": "01a1e5b5-79fb-7862-89e5-8c0b80b34c63", "kept_result_tokens": null}], "owner